  "scope": "Prospectively frozen whole-original seven-file PDF/UA table diagnostic. Three distinct independent rendered table layouts, including five identical-pixel metadata variants. Original source bytes and independently inspected Poppler grids/roles fixed before any DocWeave extraction. All four public-factory profiles run uniformly on complete originals. Geometry-only max IoU>=.5 stable-first association; positional/span topology and header-role metrics reported separately. Every source/failure and all74 anchors/profile retained; no text scoring, oracle extraction crops, source repair, per-case settings or best-of selection. Source-author synthetic validation files, not representative business or general PDF accuracy, class-span proof, PDF/UA compliance or independently human-reviewed acceptance. Candidate adds bounded explicit same-page Caption references outside table rows, validates them disjoint from real cell text, reserves them against source ownership conflicts, and leaves their glyphs to native fallback without copying them into cells. All sources/anchors/roles/ROIs/profiles and prior baseline retained unchanged. Only the three source-tagged observations on the captioned source are predeclared as potentially changed.",
